msgstr ""

#: SettingsForm.pas:687
msgid "The cursor keys are the joystick's directions and Ctrl (either) its fire button, and are not the C64's own cursor keys and CTRL (a key of the keyboard also reads as a joystick direction on the real machine). Scroll Lock switches it while running"
msgstr ""

